Generic single-database configuration.

Tables managed by Alembic migrations:

  users
    Stores registered user accounts.
    Columns: id (PK), email (unique), hashed_password, created_at
    Note: hashed_password stores a bcrypt hash — never plaintext. Auth added in Phase 3.

  expenses
    Stores individual expense records.
    Columns: id (PK), amount (Numeric 10,2), category, description, created_at, user_id (FK → users.id nullable)
    Note: user_id is nullable until Phase 3 auth enforces user context on every expense.